{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>東涌49歲男停車場燒炭亡，兒子揭發惜太遲。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>昨日 (14 日 ) 晚上 8 時 46 分，警方接獲一名男子報案，指懷疑其父親在停泊於東涌健東路 1 號一停車場的私家車內暈倒。 人員接報到場，發現該名 49 歲姓何男子倒臥車內，旁邊有一盤燒過的炭，他現場被證實死亡。警方有檢獲遺書，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:36.053264+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T03:28:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:09.760852+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:09.760852+00:00","content_hash":"f22460377ced4b38ad49317ff8db4fd191d6cc37f085b0bbf11b045ab67abeec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}